===Head to Starskiff Haven and receive Liangmu's parcel{{subst:void|<!--202030905-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|Liangmu wishes you can hand the parcel he prepared for Banxia to her. Obviously, he didn't know about Banxia's passing. Keep the parcel and discuss it with the little healer about how to deal with it.<br />It can't be a love letter, can it? Better not read it in case of cringe.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Delivery Package|20|x=1}})
{{Dialogue End}}

===Go to the location at which you promised to meet Bailu{{subst:void|<!--202030907-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|You receive the parcel and want to open it with Bailu.<br />This isn't a parcel sent to either of you, but since Banxia is no longer around, look at what he wrote.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Bailu:''' What took you so long? What kind of package is it?
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.ConsumeMissionItem",
	"SubMissionID": 202030907,
	"SimpleTalk": {}
}</pre>
:'''Bailu:''' There's a letter inside! Help me open it.
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.ShowReading",
	"BookID": {
		"IsDynamic": false,
		"FixedValue": {
			"Value": 190355
		}
	}
}</pre>
:'''Bailu:''' ...Ya!
:In a flash, Bailu grabs the letter, tears it to pieces, and hurls them into the air.
:'''Bailu:''' That Liangmu is a complete scumbag &mdash; he never cared about Banxia! He only wanted to use her to get to the elixir of immortality... Why couldn't Banxia see it?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If we'd known, we wouldn't have opened the package...
::'''Bailu:''' Right... because if we'd known, it'd be in the trash by now.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's lucky Banxia didn't see the letter.
::'''Bailu:''' Yeah, you're right.
:'''Bailu:''' That jerk better run as far as his legs will carry him! Ugh, I regret healing him so much now.
:'''Bailu:''' ...And it makes me even angrier to think that Miss Banxia might've known what he was like to begin with, but stayed with him all the same.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No way, Liangmu must've tricked her!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Love is blind.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Only she knew the truth.
:'''Bailu:''' Grownups are so complicated! I don't understand, and I don't want to understand.
:'''Bailu:''' First I was hungry, then I was angry, and now I'm hangry. *sigh* Come on (Trailblazer), let's get a bite to eat. Your treat!
